## Modern Choices

Equal 66.6667 px mathematical unit spacing, a clean 640x560 canvas,
regularized axis extensions, enlarged English/math labels, circular filled
markers, clean strokes, and semantic ink/muted colors are modern
regularization and styling. They are not facts extracted from worn source
pixels. The visible SVG colors use semantic CSS variables.
No full grid, horizontal guides, coordinate-pair captions, answer hint,
Cyrillic visible text, historical decoration, or additional task data appears.

